WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,010
Come with us

2
00:00:01,010 --> 00:00:06,010
You already know what's going on. Forget it. I'll go with you. I'll tell you a few words.

3
00:00:06,130 --> 00:00:07,050
Mr. Zhang is still in a meeting

4
00:00:07,610 --> 00:00:08,690
Please guard this floor with security

5
00:00:08,890 --> 00:00:12,480
Strangers can be stopped before going out

6
00:00:12,720 --> 00:00:15,380
Please contact this number first.

7
00:00:15,620 --> 00:00:17,620
I'll tell you right away what happened when I was taken away

8
00:00:17,820 --> 00:00:18,900
Okay, I'll go right away

9
00:00:20,170 --> 00:00:21,410
The matter has been investigated clearly

10
00:00:21,730 --> 00:00:22,970
Both sides need to deal with it calmly

11
00:00:23,330 --> 00:00:25,450
Any subsequent problems will be solved in accordance with the law

12
00:00:25,690 --> 00:00:26,730
no more conflicts

13
00:00:28,490 --> 00:00:37,760
There are half a million mistresses holding money here

14
00:00:38,240 --> 00:00:39,480
Resign from the company immediately

15
00:00:39,880 --> 00:00:45,270
From now on, give me a little more money to stay away from Zhang Yu. I won’t resign 500,000 yuan.

16
00:00:46,160 --> 00:00:47,400
You a little bodyguard

17
00:00:47,560 --> 00:00:48,800
You may not be able to earn it in a few years

18
00:00:49,360 --> 00:00:50,360
Also shameless

19
00:00:51,620 --> 00:00:52,780
I promised to protect him

20
00:00:53,560 --> 00:00:56,040
Chen Yundong will not give up halfway

21
00:00:56,480 --> 00:00:57,760
Do you really think you have the nerve to reach out?

22
00:00:57,880 --> 00:01:00,510
No one can cure you, you can try

23
00:01:04,660 --> 00:01:05,780
This is your choice
